Based on eSIM (embedded SIM card) technology, our app makes the Internet more accessible, provides a secure and stable Internet connection, and offers the biggest global coverage. Take a step into the future with eSIM, a next-generation solution that parts ways with traditional physical SIM cards!

Advantages of eSIM+:
- Money-saving: eSIM+ offers data plans at a fair price, making it a far more advantageous solution compared to roaming!
- Affordable virtual phone numbers: get as many as you want, make international calls, exchange messages, and set up social media accounts — all that while remaining completely anonymous!
- Easy to sync with all your devices: whenever you log in on another phone, you won’t lose mobile data;
- Easy to manage: purchase an unlimited number of eSIM profiles and manage them easily within your account;
- Easy to install: just a few taps, and you’re good to go;
- Flexible data plans to suit all tastes and budgets: buy mobile data to use in one, two, or multiple countries – or even on an entire continent;
- Global coverage: get a seamless Internet connection in virtually every corner of the world;
- Additional SIM cards are no longer necessary: all the acquired data plans and profiles are available on one eSIM card;
- No need to swap SIM cards: switch effortlessly between our data plans and your current mobile carrier;
- No contracts or long-term commitments. Cancel anytime!
- Our caring and responsive online tech support team are always ready to help you solve any issues!

Ticket to Unlimited Opportunities
With eSIM+, your location is of no significance, since you’re free to choose either separate data plans for 133 countries or an all-in-one data plan for any continent/region. eSIM+ has established itself as a must-have app that caters for your business and personal needs alike.


eSIM+ is more than just an app. We are a team of considerate professionals committed to providing our users with timely and high-quality service.

